                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "69f4eca4-d08b-43a3-bea3-127e26215121",
                        "source_entry_id": "78c3668b-5d97-3ac4-9ad8-996460a2aae0",
                        "source_sense_id": "20d3fd00-f800-3451-bba2-a7f4a8a1675e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Schüler einer weiterführenden Schule",
                        "target_lang_word": "student",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "student",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ce892b3-d1d3-3db6-b46f-b57022283a4f",
                                        "entry_id": "900e9f36-1942-3cd1-ba3d-2b38aebff53c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who studies or learns about a particular subject."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e2f98bb-92b6-41d3-8ffa-09a04019519f",
                                                "sense_id": "6ce892b3-d1d3-3db6-b46f-b57022283a4f",
                                                "text": "She is a student of human interactions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a61a31f-8e73-4645-b81e-cbfc82f587dc",
                                                "sense_id": "6ce892b3-d1d3-3db6-b46f-b57022283a4f",
                                                "text": "He is a student of life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bc625f9-c6ce-4d2c-940e-dbe829103b44",
                                                "sense_id": "6ce892b3-d1d3-3db6-b46f-b57022283a4f",
                                                "text": "I am not tall enough to become the function well, nor leane enough to bee thought a good Studient : but to be ſaid an honeſt man and a good houſkeeper goes as fairely, as to ſay, a carefull man, & a great ſcholler. The Competitors enter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87b0e656-bc67-4361-bc02-80853055f320",
                                                "sense_id": "6ce892b3-d1d3-3db6-b46f-b57022283a4f",
                                                "text": "The student of marine life in Southern California should become aware that […] a great many changes have taken place during the past century that have modified the characters of the plant and animal communities of the seashore."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f048fc0-2abb-3120-89c6-1e9d97f3b23b",
                                        "entry_id": "900e9f36-1942-3cd1-ba3d-2b38aebff53c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is formally enrolled at a school, a college or university, or another educational institution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "905bf065-8154-4ddf-b033-f5feab77e550",
                                                "sense_id": "8f048fc0-2abb-3120-89c6-1e9d97f3b23b",
                                                "text": "The students were out raising funds for rag week."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c54da99-58c3-4646-b80e-b2946778ffd4",
                                                "sense_id": "8f048fc0-2abb-3120-89c6-1e9d97f3b23b",
                                                "text": "In general, alſo, it may be obſerved, that a greater degree of gentility is affixed to the character of a ſtudent in England than elſewhere ; by which means our clergy have an opportunity of ſeeing better company while young, and of ſooner wearing off thoſe prejudices which they are apt to imbibe even in the beſt regulated univerſities, and which may be juſtly termed the vulgar errors of the wiſe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a141275a-c593-433c-aa45-067a287b35fe",
                                                "sense_id": "8f048fc0-2abb-3120-89c6-1e9d97f3b23b",
                                                "text": "In behalf of manhood and common sense, he would protest against such a conclusion ; and if any pale student, glued to his desk here, seek an apology for a way of life whose natural fruit is that pallid and emasculate scholarship of which New England has had too many examples, it will be far better that this sketch had not been written."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd7c2f54-fb90-4ac0-b6ab-73725633c4bd",
                                                "sense_id": "8f048fc0-2abb-3120-89c6-1e9d97f3b23b",
                                                "text": "A handful of young students bent on showing their patriotism had stirred up more trouble than they possibly could have imagined."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e9b937f-10c4-35dc-bec1-b9069c7173e8",
                                        "entry_id": "900e9f36-1942-3cd1-ba3d-2b38aebff53c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is formally enrolled at a school, a college or university, or another educational institution.",
                                            "A person who is enrolled at a college or university (as contrasted with a pupil or schoolchild attending a primary or secondary school)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in particular"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3e83a091-62da-4338-afd1-40cacafd5b6d",
                        "source_entry_id": "78c3668b-5d97-3ac4-9ad8-996460a2aae0",
                        "source_sense_id": "20d3fd00-f800-3451-bba2-a7f4a8a1675e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Schüler einer weiterführenden Schule",
                        "target_lang_word": "potache",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "potache",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4242cb43-2cdf-3cb9-8dfa-369206e2e0d1",
                                        "entry_id": "f2bb0462-465d-376f-b7b2-88210619556d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a les caractéristiques des collégiens, des lycéens, en particulier relativement à l’humour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fc75d6a-f972-4311-b00c-6b7febd75395",
                                                "sense_id": "4242cb43-2cdf-3cb9-8dfa-369206e2e0d1",
                                                "text": "En ce moment les messieurs se déplacent, je me regarde dans une glace qui est juste en face de moi, de l’autre côté de la chambre, et je me vois avec ma tête tondue, mes grandes oreilles écartées de cette tête, mon menton coupé par le col de satin noir que nous portions militairement, mon corps boudiné dans ma tunique, et cet air potache, où il y a un peu de tout, de l’enfant de troupe et du poulain trop haut sur pattes, du déluré et de l’hébété."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec60b4cf-0147-49a9-b1c7-a3b4e1a739cf",
                                                "sense_id": "4242cb43-2cdf-3cb9-8dfa-369206e2e0d1",
                                                "text": "L’ambiance est potache, avec des blagues où il faut être un homme, un vrai."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e82840e6-368a-4ac0-ad35-8db980ddad56",
                                                "sense_id": "4242cb43-2cdf-3cb9-8dfa-369206e2e0d1",
                                                "text": "Ce côté joyeusement potache, tout aussi sensible à l’écran qu’à la ville, apporte un charme fou à cette comédie où apparaissent également Blanche Gardin, Grégoire Ludig ou Benoît Poelvoorde, en méchant volontairement caricatural."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "potache",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12db9454-868b-3671-9a1b-16747c3cf5a4",
                                        "entry_id": "2c346a19-6705-3cda-bde4-9dedf48b98d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Collégien, lycéen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b4f8489-d518-4cda-a44e-d309b2366fd3",
                                                "sense_id": "12db9454-868b-3671-9a1b-16747c3cf5a4",
                                                "text": "Il n’était pas à son aise dans les brasseries d’étudiants : le milieu était trop raffiné pour lui ; il entendait avec étonnement ses voisins de table parler de philosophie ou de littérature. Il se sentait, là, petit garçon, potache."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e58fd1c-958c-4ecb-bfd2-dd89b30394a0",
                                                "sense_id": "12db9454-868b-3671-9a1b-16747c3cf5a4",
                                                "text": "Je racontais mes bonnes histoires de potache, les scies montées au pion, les farces de la classe d’allemand ; j’imitais la voix aigre du censeur, la tournure guindée du proviseur ; je donnais la comédie à madame André qui m’écoutait en riant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c666566-1413-4196-85f7-c94ab7f1cda8",
                                                "sense_id": "12db9454-868b-3671-9a1b-16747c3cf5a4",
                                                "text": "Car le premier devoir du vrai potache, c’est, hors des classes et des cours solennelles, hors des consignes et des pensums, de lancer à bouche que veux-tu et lazzis et bouffées de fumée bleuâtre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
